   329	- Contract-excluded: nonnumeric list elements.  The prompt states a list of
   330	  numbers; the target theorem does not silently claim arbitrary `Val` lists.
   331	- Not established: a separate termination/liveness theorem or equivalence to
   332	  full CPython beyond the supplied subset.

